{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal multiprofile setup, achieving 63.9% validation accuracy (vs. 61.9% for the concat fusion baseline) and 61.97% F1, suggesting potential performance benefits from the weighted approach. However, uncertainty remains about whether the improvement stems solely from the fusion method, as no direct comparisons to alternative aggregation techniques were conducted."
}

